<h1>Affiliate and sponsor disclosure</h1>
<p class="lead">How this directory makes money, and what that money does not buy.</p>
<div class="facts"><dl>
<dt>Affiliate links</dt>
<dd>Some connector pages link to a vendor with <code>rel="sponsored"</code>. If you buy or subscribe through that link, we may earn a commission. You don’t pay extra. The link is labelled on the page.</dd>
<dt>Featured listings</dt>
<dd>A maker can pay to pin a connector to the top of its category and wear a Featured badge. The pin ends on the date we agree. It does not change Online, Stale, Down, or any other status.</dd>
<dt>Sponsors</dt>
<dd>Newsletter sponsors are labelled in that week’s email. Category sponsors are labelled on the Car or Home page. <a href="/advertise/">Pricing</a>.</dd>
<dt>What is not for sale</dt>
<dd>The checker, the status badges, and the rank underneath any featured pin. Badges come from the checks described on <a href="/how-we-check/">How we check</a>.</dd>
</dl></div>
